{"seq":3,"slug":"content-pipeline","title":"内容生产管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/aigc-applications/content-pipeline","wordCount":1410,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"内容生产管线\">内容生产管线</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>企业级 AI 内容生产管线将生成式 AI 从单点工具升级为系统化的内容生产基础设施。管线涵盖从需求输入到内容输出的完整流程，包括需求解析、模板匹配、AI 生成、人工审核、后处理和分发。与单次生成不同，管线需要处理大规模批量请求、保证输出一致性、管理多版本内容，并与下游系统（CMS、CDN、广告平台）集成。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[需求输入] --&gt; B[需求解析]&#10;    B --&gt; C[模板匹配]&#10;    C --&gt; D[AI 生成]&#10;    D --&gt; E[自动质检]&#10;    E --&gt; F{合格?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[人工审核]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| D&#10;    G --&gt; H[后处理]&#10;    H --&gt; I[资产管理]&#10;    I --&gt; J[内容分发]\">graph LR\n    A[需求输入] --&gt; B[需求解析]\n    B --&gt; C[模板匹配]\n    C --&gt; D[AI 生成]\n    D --&gt; E[自动质检]\n    E --&gt; F{合格?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[人工审核]\n    F --&gt;|否| D\n    G --&gt; H[后处理]\n    H --&gt; I[资产管理]\n    I --&gt; J[内容分发]</pre><p>内容管线的设计原则是自动化优先、质量可控、可追溯和可扩展。每个环节都应该有明确的输入输出规格、质量检查点和失败回退策略。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>管线环节</th>\n<th>自动化程度</th>\n<th>核心技术</th>\n<th>质量控制</th>\n<th>关键指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>需求解析</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>NLP/LLM</td>\n<td>格式校验</td>\n<td>解析准确率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模板匹配</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>规则+检索</td>\n<td>覆盖率</td>\n<td>匹配精度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 生成</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>扩散模型/LLM</td>\n<td>多维评估</td>\n<td>CLIP Score/FID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动质检</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>CV/NLP 模型</td>\n<td>阈值配置</td>\n<td>通过率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工审核</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>标注工具</td>\n<td>评审标准</td>\n<td>审核效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后处理</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>图像处理</td>\n<td>参数检查</td>\n<td>处理质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容分发</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>API/CDN</td>\n<td>可用性监控</td>\n<td>分发延迟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"需求解析与内容规划\">需求解析与内容规划</h2><p>内容管线的第一步是将业务需求转化为可执行的生成参数。这通常涉及从结构化或半结构化的输入中提取关键信息：内容主题、目标风格、尺寸规格、品牌约束和数量要求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from dataclasses import dataclass, field&#10;&#10;@dataclass&#10;class ContentRequest:&#10;    subject: str&#10;    style: str = &quot;photorealistic&quot;&#10;    mood: str = &quot;professional&quot;&#10;    dimensions: tuple = (1024, 1024)&#10;    brand_lora: str = &quot;&quot;&#10;    quantity: int = 1&#10;    quality_threshold: float = 0.25&#10;    priority: str = &quot;normal&quot;&#10;    metadata: dict = field(default_factory=dict)&#10;&#10;@dataclass&#10;class GenerationConfig:&#10;    prompt: str&#10;    negative_prompt: str&#10;    width: int&#10;    height: int&#10;    steps: int = 25&#10;    guidance_scale: float = 7.0&#10;    lora_weights: str = &quot;&quot;&#10;    lora_scale: float = 0.8&#10;    seed: int = -1&#10;&#10;class RequestParser:&#10;    def __init__(self, template_db):&#10;        self.templates = template_db&#10;&#10;    def parse(self, request: ContentRequest) -&gt; list:&#10;        template = self.templates.get(request.style, self.templates[&quot;default&quot;])&#10;        configs = []&#10;        for i in range(request.quantity):&#10;            config = GenerationConfig(&#10;                prompt=template.format_prompt(request.subject, request.mood),&#10;                negative_prompt=template.negative_prompt,&#10;                width=request.dimensions[0],&#10;                height=request.dimensions[1],&#10;                lora_weights=request.brand_lora,&#10;                seed=i * 42 if request.quantity &gt; 1 else -1,&#10;            )&#10;            configs.append(config)&#10;        return configs\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclasses </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclass, field</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ContentRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    subject: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    style: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"photorealistic\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mood: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"professional\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dimensions: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tuple</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    brand_lora: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    quantity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    quality_threshold: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.25</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    priority: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"normal\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    metadata: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> field(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">default_factory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GenerationConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prompt: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    negative_prompt: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    width: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    height: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    steps: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 25</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    guidance_scale: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 7.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lora_weights: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lora_scale: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    seed: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RequestParser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, template_db):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.templates </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> template_db</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, request: ContentRequest) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        template </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.templates.get(request.style, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.templates[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        configs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request.quantity):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GenerationConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">template.format_prompt(request.subject, request.mood),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                negative_prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">template.negative_prompt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                width</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">request.dimensions[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                height</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">request.dimensions[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                lora_weights</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">request.brand_lora,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                seed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request.quantity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            configs.append(config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> configs</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于大规模内容生产，需求通常以批次方式提交。批次调度器负责将请求分配到 GPU 资源池，考虑优先级、显存约束和预估生成时间。常见的调度策略包括先到先服务、优先级队列和批量打包（将相同模型和分辨率的请求合并执行以提高 GPU 利用率）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批量生成与并行调度\">批量生成与并行调度</h2><p>高效的批量生成需要充分利用 GPU 并行能力。同一模型下的多个请求可以在 batch 维度上并行处理，不同模型的请求需要通过模型切换或多 GPU 分配来处理。模型权重的加载是延迟的主要瓶颈，因此模型缓存和预加载策略至关重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 调度架构&#10;        Q[请求队列] --&gt; S[调度器]&#10;        S --&gt; G1[GPU 1: SD XL]&#10;        S --&gt; G2[GPU 2: SD XL + LoRA A]&#10;        S --&gt; G3[GPU 3: SD XL + LoRA B]&#10;        G1 --&gt; R[结果收集]&#10;        G2 --&gt; R&#10;        G3 --&gt; R&#10;        R --&gt; QC[质量检查]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 调度架构\n        Q[请求队列] --&gt; S[调度器]\n        S --&gt; G1[GPU 1: SD XL]\n        S --&gt; G2[GPU 2: SD XL + LoRA A]\n        S --&gt; G3[GPU 3: SD XL + LoRA B]\n        G1 --&gt; R[结果收集]\n        G2 --&gt; R\n        G3 --&gt; R\n        R --&gt; QC[质量检查]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import asyncio&#10;from concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor&#10;&#10;class ContentPipeline:&#10;    def __init__(self, n_workers=4):&#10;        self.executor = ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=n_workers)&#10;        self.model_cache = {}&#10;        self.quality_checker = QualityChecker()&#10;&#10;    async def process_batch(self, requests):&#10;        configs = [self.parse_request(r) for r in requests]&#10;        grouped = self.group_by_model(configs)&#10;        tasks = []&#10;        for model_key, group_configs in grouped.items():&#10;            task = asyncio.get_event_loop().run_in_executor(&#10;                self.executor, self.generate_group, model_key, group_configs&#10;            )&#10;            tasks.append(task)&#10;        results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks)&#10;        flat_results = [r for group in results for r in group]&#10;        checked_results = [self.quality_check(r) for r in flat_results]&#10;        return checked_results&#10;&#10;    def group_by_model(self, configs):&#10;        groups = {}&#10;        for config in configs:&#10;            key = (config.lora_weights, config.width, config.height)&#10;            groups.setdefault(key, []).append(config)&#10;        return groups&#10;&#10;    def quality_check(self, result):&#10;        score = self.quality_checker.check(result[&quot;image&quot;], result[&quot;prompt&quot;])&#10;        result[&quot;quality_score&quot;] = score&#10;        result[&quot;passed&quot;] = score &gt;= result[&quot;threshold&quot;]&#10;        return result\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> concurrent.futures </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ThreadPoolExecutor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ContentPipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, n_workers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.executor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ThreadPoolExecutor(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_workers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_workers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model_cache </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</